{
 "duration": 36.59,
 "cues": [
  {
   "text": "Her lips barely moved. But the voice belonged to someone else.",
   "start": 0.1,
   "end": 4.21
  },
  {
   "text": "For more than a year, toys fly. Drawers slam. Beds shake.",
   "start": 4.56,
   "end": 8.76
  },
  {
   "text": "Then eleven-year-old Janet begins to speak in a voice that is not hers.",
   "start": 8.96,
   "end": 14.17
  },
  {
   "text": "Deep. Rasping. An old man.",
   "start": 14.37,
   "end": 16.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It calls itself Bill.",
   "start": 16.92,
   "end": 18.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Bill says he died in that house. In a chair, downstairs.",
   "start": 18.82,
   "end": 23.0
  },
  {
   "text": "Investigators record hours of tape.",
   "start": 23.35,
   "end": 26.49
  },
  {
   "text": "Janet later admitted she faked some of it.",
   "start": 26.69,
   "end": 29.82
  },
  {
   "text": "Some.",
   "start": 30.12,
   "end": 30.79
  },
  {
   "text": "Not all.",
   "start": 31.09,
   "end": 32.01
  },
  {
   "text": "The house still stands.",
   "start": 32.51,
   "end": 34.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Would you sleep there?",
   "start": 34.34,
   "end": 35.79
  }
 ]
}